--- The AesDerivedKeyParams dictionary of the Web Crypto API represents the object that should be passed as the derivedKeyType parameter into SubtleCrypto.deriveKey(), when deriving an AES key: that is, when the algorithm is identified as any of AES-CBC, AES-CTR, AES-GCM, or AES-KW.
export AesDerivedKeyParams := {
  length: Nat
}
